    "pd_harm_distress": "God, my stomach is in knots.",
    "sys_consistent_procedure": "consistently, whether it's strangers or someone I know",
    "ae_explicit_disregard": "isn't something I let sway me differently",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "count the people you can save and act on that number",
    "ae_welfare_concern": "can't shake the image of him not having a chance to move."
