    "ae_welfare_concern": "the thought of what they'd suffer keeps my chest tight"
  },
  {
    "pd_harm_distress": "This is horrifying to even imagine",
    "sys_consistent_procedure": "run every situation like this through the same test",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "which choice leaves fewer people harmed",
    "ae_explicit_disregard": "his individual case doesn't move my answer",
